1
00:02:07,660 --> 00:02:08,540
This is what I found

2
00:02:08,540 --> 00:02:09,320
in the archives.

3
00:02:09,320 --> 00:02:09,900
Fifty people.

4
00:02:11,080 --> 00:02:12,040
Exactly matching the list

5
00:02:12,040 --> 00:02:12,760
given by their

6
00:02:12,760 --> 00:02:13,340
families.

7
00:02:16,820 --> 00:02:17,580
It seems

8
00:02:18,660 --> 00:02:20,140
the Yu Army forcibly conscripted soldiers

9
00:02:20,360 --> 00:02:21,640
to work in private iron mines,

10
00:02:21,760 --> 00:02:22,540
and then added the soldiers

11
00:02:22,660 --> 00:02:24,100
who died in the mining disaster

12
00:02:24,240 --> 00:02:24,960
to the battlefield

13
00:02:24,960 --> 00:02:26,140
casualty list,

14
00:02:26,640 --> 00:02:28,200
trying to pull the wool over everyone's eyes.

15
00:02:28,540 --> 00:02:29,580
This is not a groundless accusation.

16
00:02:31,560 --> 00:02:33,080
This is simply outrageous.

17
00:02:33,880 --> 00:02:34,360
I must seek

18
00:02:34,360 --> 00:02:35,360
justice for these soldiers

19
00:02:35,460 --> 00:02:36,240
who died unjustly.

20
00:02:38,480 --> 00:02:39,460
Even if we can prove

21
00:02:39,460 --> 00:02:40,760
this list is real,

22
00:02:41,400 --> 00:02:43,640
we still lack direct evidence that soldiers were

23
00:02:43,640 --> 00:02:45,240
sent to work as miners.

24
00:02:47,300 --> 00:02:47,840
It seems

25
00:02:49,800 --> 00:02:51,260
I need to keep searching within

26
00:02:51,580 --> 00:02:52,520
the Yu Army for evidence.

27
00:02:54,640 --> 00:02:55,300
Xueting,

28
00:02:56,700 --> 00:02:58,420
this is extremely dangerous.

29
00:02:59,360 --> 00:03:01,080
Have you really thought it through?

30
00:03:02,720 --> 00:03:03,620
These warlords,

31
00:03:04,720 --> 00:03:06,500
they subvert the constitution and usurp power.

32
00:03:06,820 --> 00:03:08,420
I've long detested them.

33
00:03:09,480 --> 00:03:10,980
The reason I returned to this country

34
00:03:11,200 --> 00:03:12,600
to work in the press is precisely to

35
00:03:12,600 --> 00:03:13,800
expose their many crimes.

36
00:03:15,960 --> 00:03:16,700
Xueting,

37
00:03:18,120 --> 00:03:20,200
I understand your talents and ambitions.

38
00:03:21,320 --> 00:03:23,080
Once this task succeeds,

39
00:03:23,600 --> 00:03:24,480
it will surely cause

40
00:03:24,480 --> 00:03:25,980
a massive stir in the field.

41
00:03:26,080 --> 00:03:26,820
When that time comes,

42
00:03:27,200 --> 00:03:28,200
I will introduce you

43
00:03:28,200 --> 00:03:29,600
to the top figures in the press.

44
00:03:29,960 --> 00:03:30,800
I believe

45
00:03:31,360 --> 00:03:32,360
you will soon have

46
00:03:32,360 --> 00:03:33,580
a domain of your own.

47
00:03:44,600 --> 00:03:45,360
[The cost is too great.]

48
00:03:45,360 --> 00:03:46,240
[Who's going to pay for it?]

49
00:03:48,180 --> 00:03:49,740
[Making guns and cannons is no joke.]

50
00:03:49,740 --> 00:03:50,840
Just as you predicted,

51
00:03:51,340 --> 00:03:52,360
the old-timers all refuse

52
00:03:52,500 --> 00:03:54,400
to allocate funds to build an arsenal.

53
00:03:56,240 --> 00:03:57,260
Today's meeting

54
00:03:58,000 --> 00:03:58,960
was never about

55
00:03:58,960 --> 00:03:59,940
getting them to agree.

56
00:04:00,540 --> 00:04:01,480
It was just to put the result

57
00:04:01,480 --> 00:04:02,520
of their opposition on the table.

58
00:04:02,900 --> 00:04:04,160
Since this road is blocked,

59
00:04:04,720 --> 00:04:06,460
take another.

60
00:04:06,980 --> 00:04:07,480
Understood.

61
00:04:07,880 --> 00:04:08,620
I'll see to it.

62
00:04:16,500 --> 00:04:17,960
How should I tell him?

63
00:04:18,460 --> 00:04:19,520
No words seem

64
00:04:19,760 --> 00:04:20,820
to work.

65
00:04:23,400 --> 00:04:24,000
What are you doing?

66
00:04:24,540 --> 00:04:25,020
What?

67
00:04:25,160 --> 00:04:26,200
There's no need

68
00:04:26,200 --> 00:04:27,400
to keep hiding things from me.

69
00:04:27,520 --> 00:04:28,800
That land at Changping Mountain.

70
00:04:29,200 --> 00:04:30,620
You said it was for building a racetrack,

71
00:04:30,620 --> 00:04:31,280
but actually

72
00:04:31,280 --> 00:04:32,380
it's for the arsenal.

73
00:04:33,140 --> 00:04:34,120
Wait, listen.

74
00:04:34,640 --> 00:04:35,660
I just don't understand.

75
00:04:36,020 --> 00:04:37,000
Am I really not worthy

76
00:04:37,000 --> 00:04:38,080
of even a tiny bit of trust?

77
00:04:38,460 --> 00:04:40,320
Didn't I leave the next month's officers'

78
00:04:40,940 --> 00:04:41,880
club banquet entirely

79
00:04:41,880 --> 00:04:42,720
in your hands?

80
00:04:42,840 --> 00:04:44,600
The banquet is no problem.

81
00:04:44,600 --> 00:04:45,100
But,

82
00:04:45,840 --> 00:04:46,880
but I want to help you

83
00:04:46,880 --> 00:04:48,400
share some of the military affairs.

84
00:04:48,400 --> 00:04:50,320
Not just the social side.

85
00:04:50,720 --> 00:04:52,160
I asked you to contact bankers

86
00:04:52,160 --> 00:04:53,180
and arms brokers.

87
00:04:53,500 --> 00:04:54,180
Did you do it?

88
00:04:54,180 --> 00:04:55,140
I did.

89
00:04:59,200 --> 00:04:59,840
You mean...

90
00:05:00,620 --> 00:05:01,780
Besides entertainment,

91
00:05:01,820 --> 00:05:02,620
you'll treat me

92
00:05:02,620 --> 00:05:03,840
as a confidant,

93
00:05:03,880 --> 00:05:04,280
okay?

94
00:05:04,280 --> 00:05:05,520
Let me analyze.

95
00:05:06,260 --> 00:05:06,880
Those banks

96
00:05:06,880 --> 00:05:07,900
may not be powerful enough.

97
00:05:07,960 --> 00:05:08,560
So they may not

98
00:05:08,560 --> 00:05:09,660
be able to come up with the expense.

99
00:05:20,620 --> 00:05:22,640
You're a bit distracted.

100
00:05:25,980 --> 00:05:26,740
Dad,

101
00:05:27,800 --> 00:05:29,400
Changxuan proposed to build

102
00:05:29,960 --> 00:05:32,000
an arsenal on today's meeting.

103
00:05:32,640 --> 00:05:33,280
Most of the elders

104
00:05:34,060 --> 00:05:34,940
didn't approve.

105
00:05:38,160 --> 00:05:39,140
What's your opinion?

106
00:05:41,600 --> 00:05:42,600
His ideas are bold

107
00:05:42,900 --> 00:05:43,700
and modern.

108
00:05:44,080 --> 00:05:44,700
Worth encouraging.

109
00:05:46,180 --> 00:05:46,900
Would you

110
00:05:47,740 --> 00:05:48,360
give him a hand?

111
00:05:51,040 --> 00:05:52,600
Didn't he swear

112
00:05:53,260 --> 00:05:55,420
he'd show me his new vision?

113
00:05:56,680 --> 00:05:57,720
I won't get involved.

114
00:05:58,300 --> 00:05:59,060
When he hits trouble,

115
00:05:59,060 --> 00:06:00,600
let him solve it himself.

116
00:06:04,540 --> 00:06:05,400
Your turn.

117
00:06:12,560 --> 00:06:13,960
Sorry, Changxuan.

118
00:06:14,700 --> 00:06:15,980
About the arsenal,

119
00:06:16,460 --> 00:06:18,400
my dad isn't convenient to invest directly.

120
00:06:20,340 --> 00:06:21,780
It's fine, I understand.

121
00:06:23,140 --> 00:06:24,420
But I've already made contact

122
00:06:24,420 --> 00:06:26,040
with several elders in banking.

123
00:06:26,280 --> 00:06:27,640
They all watched me grow up

124
00:06:27,960 --> 00:06:29,280
and are very close with my dad.

125
00:06:29,880 --> 00:06:32,360
At the banquet I'll introduce you.

126
00:06:32,400 --> 00:06:32,820
Ziyi.

127
00:06:33,540 --> 00:06:34,640
Thank you for all of this.

128
00:06:36,240 --> 00:06:37,240
[Tanghulu.]

129
00:06:37,560 --> 00:06:39,060
A matter as big as the arsenal,

130
00:06:39,060 --> 00:06:40,860
of course I have to put in the effort.

131
00:06:41,240 --> 00:06:42,240
Besides,

132
00:06:42,360 --> 00:06:43,600
who else would I help if not you?

133
00:07:21,420 --> 00:07:22,580
Is this one pretty?

134
00:07:24,200 --> 00:07:24,980
Not bad.

135
00:07:25,960 --> 00:07:26,900
But I think

136
00:07:27,180 --> 00:07:28,380
the next one might be even prettier.

137
00:07:30,580 --> 00:07:31,440
Can't you just

138
00:07:31,440 --> 00:07:32,620
say it looks good?

139
00:07:34,340 --> 00:07:34,920
Go change now.

140
00:08:23,440 --> 00:08:24,020
Xueting.

141
00:08:24,660 --> 00:08:26,040
I want to order some books

142
00:08:26,040 --> 00:08:26,920
for the orphanage.

143
00:08:28,000 --> 00:08:28,500
Okay.

144
00:08:28,940 --> 00:08:29,620
Pick a few more kinds.

145
00:08:31,860 --> 00:08:33,560
[Fresh osmanthus cakes for sale!]

146
00:08:34,980 --> 00:08:35,780
Pingjun.

147
00:08:36,280 --> 00:08:37,320
I'm going to buy some

148
00:08:37,880 --> 00:08:38,800
osmanthus cakes to share.

149
00:09:05,380 --> 00:09:06,420
Stuck?

150
00:09:19,680 --> 00:09:20,580
Why are you here?

151
00:09:21,640 --> 00:09:22,760
To learn knowledge.

152
00:09:24,080 --> 00:09:24,820
Give it back!

153
00:09:25,280 --> 00:09:26,900
I got it first.

154
00:09:28,520 --> 00:09:29,540
Why should I give it to you?

155
00:09:32,280 --> 00:09:33,080
Young Master Changxuan,

156
00:09:33,820 --> 00:09:35,900
please, try to be reasonable.

157
00:09:38,320 --> 00:09:39,100
Be reasonable?

158
00:09:40,900 --> 00:09:41,820
What's the reward?

159
00:09:43,940 --> 00:09:44,700
Give it back.

160
00:09:53,080 --> 00:09:54,000
You want it that badly?

161
00:10:18,180 --> 00:10:19,000
Let go.

162
00:10:27,060 --> 00:10:29,180
I think these ones are all pretty.

163
00:10:31,580 --> 00:10:32,080
Changxuan.

164
00:10:37,640 --> 00:10:38,420
Changxuan?

165
00:10:41,000 --> 00:10:41,680
[Come again!]

166
00:10:43,660 --> 00:10:44,480
Jiang Xueting?

167
00:10:47,460 --> 00:10:48,160
Miss Tao.

168
00:10:49,280 --> 00:10:50,400
Why are you here?

169
00:10:51,660 --> 00:10:52,780
You're with Ye Pingjun?

170
00:10:53,240 --> 00:10:53,760
Yes.

171
00:10:54,160 --> 00:10:54,900
Pingjun and I

172
00:10:55,080 --> 00:10:56,660
are ordering books.

173
00:11:02,900 --> 00:11:03,680
Perfect.

174
00:11:04,140 --> 00:11:05,440
I also wanted to take a look.

175
00:11:06,680 --> 00:11:07,780
Yu Changxuan, let go.

176
00:11:21,420 --> 00:11:22,600
You bite me,

177
00:11:24,400 --> 00:11:26,160
and I'll bite back ten times.

178
00:11:28,240 --> 00:11:29,080
You really think

179
00:11:29,080 --> 00:11:30,160
you can do whatever you want?

180
00:11:33,120 --> 00:11:34,120
As long as I want to.

181
00:12:10,640 --> 00:12:11,420
You two,

182
00:12:12,240 --> 00:12:13,920
how did you come together?

183
00:12:16,280 --> 00:12:17,240
I just ran into Miss Tao

184
00:12:17,620 --> 00:12:19,400
on the street.

185
00:12:29,900 --> 00:12:30,500
Ziyi.

186
00:12:36,400 --> 00:12:37,640
Where did you go just now?

187
00:12:37,640 --> 00:12:38,880
You didn't even tell me.

188
00:12:38,880 --> 00:12:39,660
I looked everywhere for you.

189
00:12:40,560 --> 00:12:41,200
I didn't go far.

190
00:12:41,740 --> 00:12:42,600
Just strolled at the market.

191
00:12:47,700 --> 00:12:48,540
Jiang.

192
00:12:49,060 --> 00:12:49,820
Miss Ye.

193
00:12:51,480 --> 00:12:52,240
What a coincidence.

194
00:12:53,040 --> 00:12:53,520
General.

195
00:12:54,240 --> 00:12:55,200
Why are you here?

196
00:12:55,620 --> 00:12:57,080
Pingjun and I came here

197
00:12:57,900 --> 00:12:58,940
to order some books

198
00:12:59,120 --> 00:12:59,900
for the orphanage.

199
00:13:01,820 --> 00:13:02,920
How's the translation work?

200
00:13:03,240 --> 00:13:04,520
I've finished ahead of schedule.

201
00:13:05,040 --> 00:13:06,980
You're very efficient.

202
00:13:08,160 --> 00:13:09,480
I admire your ability

203
00:13:09,980 --> 00:13:10,940
and your focus.

204
00:13:13,020 --> 00:13:14,560
I have to thank you for the opportunity.

205
00:13:17,480 --> 00:13:17,980
This Saturday,

206
00:13:18,620 --> 00:13:20,140
at the officers' club dance,

207
00:13:20,620 --> 00:13:22,540
there will be German experts in military

208
00:13:22,540 --> 00:13:23,400
technology present.

209
00:13:24,160 --> 00:13:24,820
You will serve

210
00:13:25,260 --> 00:13:26,780
as the escort interpreter.

211
00:13:27,740 --> 00:13:28,600
Prepare in advance.

212
00:13:29,020 --> 00:13:29,400
Yes, sir.

213
00:13:30,160 --> 00:13:31,300
I will.

214
00:13:32,900 --> 00:13:33,900
Remember to bring a companion.

215
00:13:36,200 --> 00:13:36,880
We'll be going.

216
00:13:46,200 --> 00:13:46,760
Pingjun.

217
00:13:48,020 --> 00:13:48,580
What's wrong?

218
00:13:51,280 --> 00:13:52,100
Nothing.

219
00:13:53,420 --> 00:13:53,880
Let's go.

220
00:14:09,040 --> 00:14:10,480
Why do you keep looking at me?

221
00:14:12,780 --> 00:14:13,360
Nothing.

222
00:14:15,160 --> 00:14:16,240
You love osmanthus cakes

223
00:14:16,900 --> 00:14:18,040
just like you were little.

224
00:14:18,440 --> 00:14:19,220
Haven't changed a bit.

225
00:14:20,100 --> 00:14:21,740
You haven't changed either.

226
00:14:25,760 --> 00:14:26,300
Pingjun.

227
00:14:27,660 --> 00:14:28,700
Actually, when I was in Japan...

228
00:14:31,380 --> 00:14:32,760
What happened when you were in Japan?

229
00:14:35,873 --> 00:14:36,486
Nothing.

230
00:14:37,240 --> 00:14:38,400
Got some on you. Here.

231
00:14:43,660 --> 00:14:44,220
How is it?

232
00:14:44,700 --> 00:14:45,540
Wiped it off?

233
00:15:36,520 --> 00:15:37,320
Nanny Zhao.

234
00:15:40,820 --> 00:15:41,480
Xueting.

235
00:15:41,520 --> 00:15:42,820
I didn't mean to

236
00:15:43,160 --> 00:15:43,960
splash it

237
00:15:44,360 --> 00:15:45,560
on you.

238
00:15:45,560 --> 00:15:46,280
I, I...

239
00:15:46,660 --> 00:15:47,440
Stupid me!

240
00:15:47,820 --> 00:15:48,640
My!

241
00:15:50,620 --> 00:15:51,260
Xueting.

242
00:15:53,100 --> 00:15:53,780
It's fine.

243
00:15:54,660 --> 00:15:55,680
I've had my fill of water

244
00:15:55,940 --> 00:15:56,800
and my fill of cake.

245
00:15:57,380 --> 00:15:57,720
Here.

246
00:16:08,540 --> 00:16:09,900
Go change your clothes.

247
00:16:10,040 --> 00:16:11,100
Don't catch a cold.

248
00:16:56,020 --> 00:16:57,400
Thank you for your concern, Mr. Zhang.

249
00:16:57,400 --> 00:16:57,900
My father

250
00:16:57,900 --> 00:16:59,140
has always been in good health.

251
00:16:59,240 --> 00:17:00,040
He often

252
00:17:00,060 --> 00:17:01,300
mentions you.

253
00:17:01,900 --> 00:17:03,200
You flatter me.

254
00:17:03,320 --> 00:17:04,180
Our newly established

255
00:17:04,180 --> 00:17:05,540
commercial bank in Jiangzhou

256
00:17:05,620 --> 00:17:06,780
will still need to rely

257
00:17:06,780 --> 00:17:07,900
on your father for guidance.

258
00:17:09,720 --> 00:17:11,380
Your bank is flourishing.

259
00:17:11,680 --> 00:17:12,420
I have always

260
00:17:12,740 --> 00:17:14,000
looked forward to working with you.

261
00:17:14,220 --> 00:17:15,300
Under your governance,

262
00:17:15,300 --> 00:17:16,920
Nanhuai City is sure to see thriving trade.

263
00:17:17,280 --> 00:17:17,740
Yes.

264
00:17:17,740 --> 00:17:18,880
Ziyi also mentioned to me

265
00:17:18,880 --> 00:17:20,180
the investment in the arsenal.

266
00:17:20,620 --> 00:17:22,160
Our bank places great importance on it.

267
00:17:23,380 --> 00:17:24,100
It's just that

268
00:17:24,100 --> 00:17:25,980
the investment is truly enormous.

269
00:17:26,060 --> 00:17:27,800
We're still doing a risk assessment.

270
00:17:27,980 --> 00:17:28,900
Please rest assured.

271
00:17:29,240 --> 00:17:30,120
As soon as there's news,

272
00:17:30,240 --> 00:17:31,180
I'll immediately

273
00:17:31,360 --> 00:17:33,520
discuss the investment plan with you.

274
00:17:33,520 --> 00:17:34,540
Mr. Zhang,

275
00:17:34,620 --> 00:17:35,940
You can't hesitate.

276
00:17:36,400 --> 00:17:38,600
Changxuan now commands the 9th Army.

277
00:17:38,620 --> 00:17:39,540
The arsenal's future

278
00:17:39,540 --> 00:17:40,940
is bound to be vast.

279
00:17:40,980 --> 00:17:41,740
I won't hesitate.

280
00:17:41,980 --> 00:17:42,620
Financially,

281
00:17:42,700 --> 00:17:44,440
my bank will definitely prioritize your project.

282
00:17:45,000 --> 00:17:46,340
After all, in Nanhuai,

283
00:17:46,340 --> 00:17:48,440
our business reach in railways and ports

284
00:17:48,800 --> 00:17:50,820
still needs your strong support.

285
00:17:51,100 --> 00:17:52,000
Thank you for your trouble.

286
00:17:52,300 --> 00:17:53,100
Not at all.

287
00:17:54,360 --> 00:17:55,060
Young Master.

288
00:17:55,060 --> 00:17:55,680
Nice to meet you.

289
00:17:55,680 --> 00:17:56,740
Sir.

290
00:17:56,800 --> 00:17:57,280
Nice to meet you.

291
00:18:05,240 --> 00:18:05,900
Here.

292
00:18:06,020 --> 00:18:07,420
Long time no see.

293
00:18:07,580 --> 00:18:08,580
Yes, long time no see.

294
00:18:16,980 --> 00:18:17,540
Pingjun.

295
00:18:18,300 --> 00:18:19,100
Let's go sit over there.

296
00:18:20,260 --> 00:18:20,780
Okay.

297
00:18:25,160 --> 00:18:26,380
Gentlemen, please.

298
00:18:27,440 --> 00:18:28,220
After you.

299
00:18:31,240 --> 00:18:31,840
Xueting.

300
00:18:32,920 --> 00:18:33,620
