00:30:24,660 --> 00:30:25,100
One Bamboo.

601
00:30:25,560 --> 00:30:26,220
Changxuan,

602
00:30:27,140 --> 00:30:28,540
Why aren't you taking any tiles?

603
00:30:29,960 --> 00:30:31,180
Bad luck?

604
00:30:31,860 --> 00:30:32,800
My girlfriend is here.

605
00:30:33,040 --> 00:30:33,960
Good luck

606
00:30:34,460 --> 00:30:35,780
should be saved for her.

607
00:30:37,620 --> 00:30:39,920
No wonder I'm

608
00:30:39,940 --> 00:30:40,900
so lucky today.

609
00:30:41,920 --> 00:30:42,480
White dragon.

610
00:30:44,880 --> 00:30:45,500
West Wind.

611
00:30:55,660 --> 00:30:56,120
Nine Bamboos.

612
00:30:59,640 --> 00:31:00,320
Jiang,

613
00:31:01,520 --> 00:31:02,620
you're ready to win?

614
00:31:03,540 --> 00:31:04,340
Who loses and who wins

615
00:31:04,340 --> 00:31:05,620
is still hard to say.

616
00:31:08,200 --> 00:31:08,860
Secretary Jiang,

617
00:31:10,240 --> 00:31:11,880
You and Miss Ye's relationship

618
00:31:11,880 --> 00:31:12,540
seems

619
00:31:13,540 --> 00:31:14,180
very good.

620
00:31:16,120 --> 00:31:17,400
Since Xueting and I

621
00:31:17,400 --> 00:31:18,420
were young,

622
00:31:18,420 --> 00:31:20,420
we have shared the same interests.

623
00:31:20,820 --> 00:31:22,560
During the years he studied abroad,

624
00:31:22,600 --> 00:31:23,800
our letters to each other

625
00:31:23,800 --> 00:31:24,680
never stopped.

626
00:31:27,300 --> 00:31:27,860
Nine Circles.

627
00:31:30,680 --> 00:31:32,620
Such an unbreakable bond

628
00:31:33,480 --> 00:31:34,860
is truly enviable.

629
00:31:36,040 --> 00:31:36,940
Right, Changxuan?

630
00:31:43,880 --> 00:31:44,420
Four Characters.

631
00:31:44,760 --> 00:31:45,220
Pung.

632
00:31:48,020 --> 00:31:48,640
Five Characters.

633
00:31:51,220 --> 00:31:51,620
Seven Circles.

634
00:31:52,780 --> 00:31:53,240
Pung.

635
00:31:56,320 --> 00:31:56,700
Eight Characters.

636
00:31:57,020 --> 00:31:57,540
Kong.

637
00:31:59,240 --> 00:32:00,240
The last Eight Characters,

638
00:32:00,240 --> 00:32:01,180
and you drew it.

639
00:32:01,460 --> 00:32:02,620
Alright, Changxuan.

640
00:32:03,040 --> 00:32:04,400
Your luck is back.

641
00:32:11,000 --> 00:32:11,480
Three Characters.

642
00:32:11,480 --> 00:32:12,000
Pung.

643
00:32:15,240 --> 00:32:15,700
Eight Circles.

644
00:32:18,240 --> 00:32:19,180
Mr. Yang,

645
00:32:19,220 --> 00:32:21,040
you're just one tile away

646
00:32:21,180 --> 00:32:22,360
from winning.

647
00:32:23,700 --> 00:32:26,280
I have everything ready,

648
00:32:26,860 --> 00:32:28,740
just lacking the last tile.

649
00:32:36,140 --> 00:32:36,720
Five Characters.

650
00:32:49,720 --> 00:32:50,620
Careful.

651
00:32:51,520 --> 00:32:52,660
The tile in your hand

652
00:32:52,660 --> 00:32:54,080
might be the one I need.

653
00:32:55,920 --> 00:32:56,700
Yes.

654
00:32:56,980 --> 00:32:58,300
You'd better be cautious.

655
00:32:58,620 --> 00:33:00,080
The outcome of this hand

656
00:33:00,400 --> 00:33:01,840
concerns a man's dignity.

657
00:33:04,080 --> 00:33:04,900
Secretary Jiang,

658
00:33:05,120 --> 00:33:06,060
no need to be so nervous.

659
00:33:07,840 --> 00:33:09,180
Show some nerve.

660
00:33:20,840 --> 00:33:22,100
It's fine, Xueting.

661
00:33:22,380 --> 00:33:23,740
It's just a dance.

662
00:33:24,440 --> 00:33:25,860
No matter who the dancing partner is,

663
00:33:26,600 --> 00:33:27,780
I'm your girl.

664
00:33:36,420 --> 00:33:38,880
Miss Ye is truly generous.

665
00:33:40,540 --> 00:33:42,240
A true heroine!

666
00:33:42,480 --> 00:33:43,020
Good.

667
00:33:49,440 --> 00:33:49,980
East wind.

668
00:33:59,260 --> 00:34:00,060
Major Yang,

669
00:34:00,720 --> 00:34:01,360
aren't you

670
00:34:01,980 --> 00:34:02,700
going to win?

671
00:34:05,280 --> 00:34:06,300
I'm not winning.

672
00:34:06,800 --> 00:34:08,320
The tile I want isn't this one.

673
00:34:18,520 --> 00:34:19,260
Three Circles.

674
00:34:23,560 --> 00:34:24,020
One Circle.

675
00:34:27,380 --> 00:34:27,880
Three Characters.

676
00:34:30,860 --> 00:34:31,360
One Character.

677
00:34:32,960 --> 00:34:33,620
Four Bamboos.

678
00:34:42,320 --> 00:34:42,800
I win.

679
00:34:49,180 --> 00:34:50,120
Alas.

680
00:34:50,180 --> 00:34:50,940
Lady Luck

681
00:34:50,940 --> 00:34:52,960
has really blessed him.

682
00:34:54,480 --> 00:34:56,600
Seems I'm not favored

683
00:34:56,600 --> 00:34:58,140
to ask Miss Ye for a dance.

684
00:35:25,520 --> 00:35:26,440
They say Changxuan

685
00:35:26,440 --> 00:35:28,040
is invincible at the mahjong table.

686
00:35:28,680 --> 00:35:30,660
Today you were really a bit half-hearted.

687
00:35:33,240 --> 00:35:34,620
I'm not skilled enough.

688
00:35:35,440 --> 00:35:37,020
Is it poor skills,

689
00:35:37,520 --> 00:35:39,100
or sparing the fair lady?

690
00:35:42,880 --> 00:35:44,160
It's a pity.

691
00:35:44,940 --> 00:35:46,060
The king has feelings,

692
00:35:46,700 --> 00:35:48,060
but the goddess does not.

693
00:36:28,820 --> 00:36:29,520
Excuse me.

694
00:36:29,700 --> 00:36:30,880
Let me help you wipe that.

695
00:36:31,100 --> 00:36:31,560
No need.

696
00:36:31,600 --> 00:36:32,460
We'll clean it up.

697
00:36:32,640 --> 00:36:33,100
What?

698
00:36:33,220 --> 00:36:33,880
Miss,

699
00:36:34,820 --> 00:36:36,400
this dress doesn't suit you.

700
00:36:36,760 --> 00:36:38,820
I'll compensate you with a better one.

701
00:36:39,600 --> 00:36:40,160
Pingjun.

702
00:36:43,740 --> 00:36:44,480
What's wrong?

703
00:36:44,660 --> 00:36:45,260
What happened?

704
00:36:46,040 --> 00:36:46,460
Nothing.

705
00:36:46,700 --> 00:36:47,540
You are...

706
00:36:47,620 --> 00:36:48,680
The buyer from Rheinmetall Company

707
00:36:48,680 --> 00:36:49,600
wants to leave now.

708
00:36:50,020 --> 00:36:50,900
We'll

709
00:36:51,060 --> 00:36:51,840
see him off.

710
00:36:55,120 --> 00:36:55,620
It's fine.

711
00:36:55,700 --> 00:36:56,880
I can handle it myself.

712
00:36:56,920 --> 00:36:57,820
Go do what you need to do.

713
00:36:58,780 --> 00:36:59,600
Be careful then.

714
00:36:59,600 --> 00:37:00,340
Go.

715
00:37:01,000 --> 00:37:01,460
Let's go.

716
00:37:01,520 --> 00:37:01,760
Go.

717
00:37:01,760 --> 00:37:02,080
Here.

718
00:37:47,680 --> 00:37:48,460
Yu Changxuan?

719
00:37:49,980 --> 00:37:51,060
What are you doing?

720
00:37:52,380 --> 00:37:53,200
You're drunk.

721
00:37:55,180 --> 00:37:56,300
Now you know fear?

722
00:38:01,920 --> 00:38:03,380
Weren't you sharp-tongued

723
00:38:03,380 --> 00:38:04,920
at the mahjong table just now?

724
00:38:06,480 --> 00:38:08,420
Seems you didn't tell your boyfriend

725
00:38:09,620 --> 00:38:10,620
about our relationship.

726
00:38:12,620 --> 00:38:14,120
There was never any relationship

727
00:38:15,040 --> 00:38:16,460
between us.

728
00:38:17,820 --> 00:38:18,940
No relationship?

729
00:38:22,200 --> 00:38:23,580
Who doesn't know that you, Ye Pingjun,

730
00:38:25,460 --> 00:38:26,900
are mine?

731
00:38:29,020 --> 00:38:29,500
That was just

732
00:38:29,500 --> 00:38:31,220
acting at your birthday party.

733
00:38:32,260 --> 00:38:33,160
It was all fake.

734
00:38:33,160 --> 00:38:34,620
You know that perfectly well.

735
00:38:40,540 --> 00:38:41,720
Then what are you afraid of?

736
00:38:43,640 --> 00:38:44,620
What are you hiding from?

737
00:38:48,420 --> 00:38:50,040
Why not tell Jiang Xueting

738
00:38:50,980 --> 00:38:52,020
what we are to each other?

739
00:38:52,380 --> 00:38:53,700
Because you don't matter.

740
00:38:57,200 --> 00:38:58,020
Yu Changxuan.

741
00:38:59,280 --> 00:39:00,420
Did you hear me?

742
00:39:01,660 --> 00:39:03,020
Because you don't matter.

743
00:39:04,120 --> 00:39:05,200
You don't matter so much

744
00:39:05,640 --> 00:39:06,260
that I don't think

745
00:39:06,260 --> 00:39:07,740
I need to mention

746
00:39:08,320 --> 00:39:09,640
anything about you to him.

747
00:39:10,240 --> 00:39:11,320
Because in my life,

748
00:39:11,320 --> 00:39:12,780
you're not even worth mentioning.

749
00:39:23,760 --> 00:39:24,400
Pingjun.

750
00:39:27,420 --> 00:39:28,580
Pingjun, are you in there?

751
00:39:31,140 --> 00:39:32,500
Yu Changxuan, don't go crazy.

752
00:39:34,780 --> 00:39:36,720
You'd better not push me.

753
00:39:41,880 --> 00:39:43,260
That Jiang

754
00:39:44,820 --> 00:39:46,260
has no power, no influence.

755
00:39:48,320 --> 00:39:49,520
What's so good about him?

756
00:39:49,980 --> 00:39:50,940
Everything about him is good.

757
00:39:57,400 --> 00:39:58,760
You really think you can get away?

758
00:40:01,600 --> 00:40:02,760
Let go of me.

759
00:40:06,240 --> 00:40:06,820
Pingjun.

760
00:40:08,940 --> 00:40:09,620
Pingjun.

761
00:40:24,540 --> 00:40:25,280
What?

762
00:40:27,620 --> 00:40:28,820
You want him to know

763
00:40:29,760 --> 00:40:31,000
about us that badly?

764
00:40:34,760 --> 00:40:35,380
Pingjun.

765
00:40:37,620 --> 00:40:38,480
Tell me,

766
00:40:40,700 --> 00:40:41,580
if he saw us

767
00:40:41,580 --> 00:40:43,460
like this,

768
00:40:46,240 --> 00:40:47,120
what would he think?

769
00:40:56,780 --> 00:40:57,460
Pingjun.

770
00:40:58,240 --> 00:40:59,060
Are you in there?

771
00:41:11,620 --> 00:41:12,880
Your heart's beating so fast.

772
00:41:16,060 --> 00:41:17,500
That afraid of him finding out?
